      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "How suggestions are made",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 18,
          "startingLine": 75
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Everything below is computed from four inputs you control: the **playbook rules** (roles per meta and per pick slot), your **tier list**, your **Ranked-Eligible** roster, and your **own results** (archived battles + logged ranked series). No hidden data; every number shown here is the live value and is editable in the other sections.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 18,
          "startingLine": 76
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Tip: hover any recommendation card in a draft to see its exact score breakdown.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 18,
          "startingLine": 91
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "%lld",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 18,
          "startingLine": 97
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "DATA BALANCE",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 18,
          "startingLine": 169
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Every brawler in every archived game is recorded from its own side's result, so opponents and teammates build records too — not just the brawlers you play.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 18,
          "startingLine": 170
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Battles archived before this update kept no team list, so their opponents can't be counted. New fetches include them.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 22,
          "startingLine": 183
        }
